ur new job.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"> Oracle database to run in a set of clustered servers, if one fails, the system will keep working with the remaining ones.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"> You can use Online Table Redefinition as well; it will reorganize scripts and tables, even when it is used by the client.</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Causes of Downtime"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are many reasons why a database is in downtime."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Databases need to apply patches or upgrades, those are usually the reasons for scheduled downtimes, but sometimes the downtimes are due to reasons beyond their control, the following chart list the most common causes."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Can be scheduled by the administrators </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Can never be controlled </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Software upgrades\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hardware failure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hardware upgrades\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Human error\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Applying patches\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Software failures\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Servers Maintenance\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Natural disasters \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "availability "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when a database is online and ready to 